    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  你和诗怀雅刚才那出，难道不是为了加强和罗德岛之间的合作吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "你和诗怀雅刚才那出，难道不是为了加强和罗德岛之间的合作吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  怎么到了罗德岛这边，你又临阵变卦，不按说好的来？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "怎么到了罗德岛这边，你又临阵变卦，不按说好的来？"
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#6\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你弄错了，星熊。我没这个打算。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你弄错了，星熊。我没这个打算。"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#6\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  可能吧。至少我更乐意看你说实话。你的表情也比刚才坦然多了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "可能吧。至少我更乐意看你说实话。你的表情也比刚才坦然多了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  不过确实，把我放在他那个位置，我一样会很恼火。你得庆幸那个罗德岛的战士还挺好说话。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "不过确实，把我放在他那个位置，我一样会很恼火。你得庆幸那个罗德岛的战士还挺好说话。"
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  这么说吧，我知道时间紧迫，可我也弄不明白——为什么你要把阿米娅他们那么干脆地留在废城？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "这么说吧，我知道时间紧迫，可我也弄不明白——为什么你要把阿米娅他们那么干脆地留在废城？"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  不确定因素太多了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "不确定因素太多了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  废城的地况不适合近卫局战斗，我们也很难估计废城内整合运动的实力。我们的队伍不能承担这种风险。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "废城的地况不适合近卫局战斗，我们也很难估计废城内整合运动的实力。我们的队伍不能承担这种风险。"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  这说服不了我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "这说服不了我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  ……星熊，我们的行动是被规划好的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "……星熊，我们的行动是被规划好的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  命令就是命令，我会服从。但你该亲自和我说，而不是让我等到诗怀雅来告知我。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "命令就是命令，我会服从。但你该亲自和我说，而不是让我等到诗怀雅来告知我。"
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  在当今事态成真之前，命令的具体内容是机密的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "在当今事态成真之前，命令的具体内容是机密的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  所以是魏先生亲自下的命令。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "所以是魏先生亲自下的命令。"
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你可以随便猜测。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你可以随便猜测。"
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  即使现在是，我也不知道你们的具体目标，在龙门没什么人能让近卫局做到这步。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "即使现在是，我也不知道你们的具体目标，在龙门没什么人能让近卫局做到这步。"
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  只可能是这样。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "只可能是这样。"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  我确实很佩服魏先生。但我不会敬重他，今天发生的一切就是原因之一。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "我确实很佩服魏先生。但我不会敬重他，今天发生的一切就是原因之一。"
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  这一切都是必要的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "这一切都是必要的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  你在说服你自己。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "你在说服你自己。"
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  唉，老陈，你要么是想得太多，要么是连自己都说服不了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "唉，老陈，你要么是想得太多，要么是连自己都说服不了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  可能吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "可能吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  帮我接诗怀雅。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "帮我接诗怀雅。"
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",name2=\"char_015_lmg\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1.png",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"近卫局成员\"]  明白。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "近卫局成员",
        "content": "明白。"
    },
