    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  喂？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "喂？"
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  诗怀雅，我们已经离开了罗德岛，你那边可以开始了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "诗怀雅，我们已经离开了罗德岛，你那边可以开始了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  刚才骂我骂得挺舒服的，嗯？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "刚才骂我骂得挺舒服的，嗯？"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  我们关系很差，但没差到那个地步。我是有点虚张声势。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我们关系很差，但没差到那个地步。我是有点虚张声势。"
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  但我可不是，我骂爽了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "但我可不是，我骂爽了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你这家伙……",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你这家伙……"
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  行，行。真奇怪，我们都只知道自己的任务，却一点也不知道对方的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "行，行。真奇怪，我们都只知道自己的任务，却一点也不知道对方的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  还有，我听说了，你为什么不希望罗德岛插手？这是某种程度的赎罪吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "还有，我听说了，你为什么不希望罗德岛插手？这是某种程度的赎罪吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  我相信罗德岛的能力，也相信阿米娅和Dr.{@nickname}。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我相信罗德岛的能力，也相信阿米娅和Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  所以我不想让他们介入现在的情况，他们只会是不确定的因素。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "所以我不想让他们介入现在的情况，他们只会是不确定的因素。"
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  甚至是那个凯尔希。她绝不会按我们的规划行事。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "甚至是那个凯尔希。她绝不会按我们的规划行事。"
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  我没见过那家伙。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "我没见过那家伙。"
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  没必要见了。有点像你祖父，而且不用每天戴着呼吸机。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "没必要见了。有点像你祖父，而且不用每天戴着呼吸机。"
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  各自开工吧。不过我要先去找个人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "各自开工吧。不过我要先去找个人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  随你。记得看时间。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "随你。记得看时间。"
    },
